<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H22761</pnldref><english><title>Belong / profess to belong to a proscribed organisation - terrorism</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>BELONGED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>BELONGING</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>PROFESS TO</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>PROFESSED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>IRA</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>INLA</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>IRISH</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>REPUBLICAN</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>NATIONALIST</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>LIBERATION</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ARMY</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>UVF</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>UDF</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ULSTER</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>VOLUNTEER</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DEFENCE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>FORCE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>TERRORIST</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..),&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; (A)_[belonged]_&lt;br /&gt; (B)_[professed to belong]_&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; to a proscribed organisation, namely **(..SPECIFY ORGANISATION..)</standardoffencewording><legislation>Contrary to section 11(1) and (3) of the Terrorism Act 2000.</legislation><pointstoprove>date and location&lt;br /&gt;belongs/professes to belong to &lt;br /&gt;a proscribed organisation</pointstoprove><investigatoractions><investigatoraction><code>IA1</code><description>Fingerprint and photograph</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA2</code><description>DNA Samples: If crime scene stain present - take evidential sample If no crime scene stain and DNA not confirmed on PNC - take Criminal Justice sample. If DNA confirmed on PNC - CJ sample not required</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA27</code><description>Confirm proposed charge is appropriately authorised (Police or CPS)</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA28</code><description>Ensure compliance with investigator's obligations re disclosure</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA29</code><description>Consider if case suitable for referral to Financial Investigation Unit and CPS for asset recovery eg confiscation order</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA3</code><description>Audio record interview unless exempt</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA4</code><description>PNC recordable</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA5</code><description>Submit a crime report</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA6</code><description>Offences brought to justice scheme</description></investigatoraction></investigatoractions><policeandcpschargingresponsibilities>D27968</policeandcpschargingresponsibilities><notes>(i) The consent of the Director of Public Prosecutions or the Attorney General is required, section 117 of the Terrorism Act 2000.&lt;br /&gt;(ii) See Schedule 2 for list of proscribed organisations.&lt;br /&gt;(iii) See Section 11(2) for basis upon which defence may challenge.&lt;br /&gt;(iv) This offence applies to acts done outside the United Kingdom, regardless of the nationality of the offender, section 17 of the Terrorism Act 2006.&lt;br /&gt;(v) For offences committed before 29th June 2021, the maximum penalty is ten years, see H3551/PT00026.</notes></english><indictment><indictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></indictmentindicator><structuredindictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></structuredindictmentindicator></indictment><other><powersofarrest>Arrest without warrant</powersofarrest><modeoftrial><code>EWAY</co